+- `afterModelResponse` now receives aggregate provider-call usage for the entire turn, including every tool round, instead of only the final provider call. **Migration note**: existing consumers that bill, audit or budget from this hook will record larger totals for tool-using turns; direct-answer turns are unchanged.
